id: pm-fkhdy8
title: "TOON get --fields drops an empty child collection nested inside a selected object field, while JSON keeps it"
description: "CodeRabbit review of PR 1681 (deferred). restoreRequestedEmptyItemCollections restores the empty collections an explicit get --fields selection requested at the top level of item. When a selected object field contains a scalar and an empty child array, TOON compaction still drops the nested array while JSON keeps it, so absent vs empty differs by encoding inside selected objects."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 3
