author: "harness:claude-code"
acceptance_criteria: "TOON get --fields renders every empty collection inside selected fields, recursively, exactly as JSON delivers it; JSON, SDK and MCP output are unchanged; a spec covers a nested scalar-plus-empty-array field with a negative control"
